      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Recent IK Beta seems to of changed some functionality that affected legacy too. The locking doesn't work there anymore. When a tracker turns off, it's IK point merges with another random tracker and then locks.\n*Edit~ It works still! As long as the tracker you turn off first is the one that was turned on and connected to SteamVR LAST.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
