      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Major +1 on this. We've had the ability to freeze trackers in KinectToVR since January, and people with Vive trackers are jealous of the feature. It's something I can't live without myself. I hope everyone can get it.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
