        "like": 1
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I myself remove the HMD and tracker before going to bed, so it would be great if you could provide this tracker freeze function.\nBeing able to freeze the tracker would make it easier to do the following\nFirst, when I put on the bedtime pose, I fix the tracker, then I put the HMD (I use Quest2) to sleep and remove the tracker.\nIn the morning, you can put the tracker back on and still maintain your sleeping pose in the meantime.\nTranslated with www.DeepL.com/Translator (free version)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
